5461
04:25:07,880 --> 04:25:09,680
You can be, uh...

5462
04:25:09,680 --> 04:25:10,460
Jimmy version 2.

5463
04:25:34,920 --> 04:25:38,780
I still can't decide whether or not the gunpowder needs to go in...

5464
04:25:39,440 --> 04:25:39,840
crafting?

5465
04:25:41,580 --> 04:25:41,980
Or...

5466
