5498
04:26:58,980 --> 04:27:03,720
Criminal activity has been spotted in that region, and I have been dispatched to take care of it.

5499
04:27:04,900 --> 04:27:14,140
And as part of that routine, I have to make sure that all their chests are empty per regulation, so I need to empty them and take those things with me home to inspect, you know?

5500
