5512
04:27:37,040 --> 04:27:37,900
Raw food.

5513
04:27:40,360 --> 04:27:42,700
Pufferfish is a alchemy ingredient.

5514
04:27:43,980 --> 04:27:45,140
So is the water bottle.

5515
04:27:45,140 --> 04:27:47,180
Lily pad, I would say...

5516
04:27:47,180 --> 04:27:47,860
Uh...

5517
04:27:47,860 --> 04:27:48,360
In here.

5518
04:27:50,980 --> 04:27:51,940
Bowl is...

5519
04:27:51,940 --> 04:27:53,020
Gotta be crafting.

5520
04:27:54,040 --> 04:27:56,140
Ooh, but it's also food-related, though.

5521
04:27:56,260 --> 04:27:57,940
But it could also be other things related, maybe?

5522
