5553
04:29:23,160 --> 04:29:23,480
Whatever.

5554
04:29:24,420 --> 04:29:25,000
Uh...

5555
04:29:25,000 --> 04:29:25,560
Floor...

5556
04:29:25,560 --> 04:29:25,960
Gold warm.

5557
04:29:26,320 --> 04:29:27,100
