We're gonna smoke those feet.

5561
04:29:36,700 --> 04:29:38,040
Smoke the feet, people.

5562
04:29:39,800 --> 04:29:40,660
Uh, wait, wait.

5563
04:29:40,740 --> 04:29:40,920
No, no.

5564
04:29:41,220 --> 04:29:41,960
